{"sourceBlobSha1":"b8c1fc78f1da857536975581716f0082f444afb1","description":"Correct service menu placement: immediately left of Hero, upward drawer, no journal space consumed.","edits":[{"name":"remove service bar from quest layout","old":"      const actions=Array.from(bar.children)","new":"      bar.style.setProperty('display','none','important');\n      const actions=Array.from(bar.children)"},{"name":"find toggle in navigation rather than old bar","old":"if(!bar.querySelector('#az-services-toggle')){","new":"if(!document.getElementById('az-services-toggle')){"},{"name":"place menu immediately before Hero","old":"bar.append(toggle);","new":"const nav=document.getElementById('bnav'),hero=nav.querySelector('[data-tab=hero]');nav.insertBefore(toggle,hero);nav.style.setProperty('grid-template-columns','repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr))','important');toggle.style.flex='1';toggle.innerHTML='<span class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\">≡</span>Меню';"},{"name":"drawer layout","old":"dialog.style.cssText='width:min(360px,90vw);max-height:85dvh;overflow:auto';","new":"dialog.style.cssText='position:fixed;inset:auto auto calc(76px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)) 12px;margin:0;width:min(340px,calc(100vw - 24px));max-height:65dvh;overflow:auto;padding:18px;border:1px solid #b69c63;border-radius:14px;background:#251f16;color:#f6e4bb;box-shadow:0 -8px 32px #0008';"},{"name":"open upward without invoking nav tab handler","old":"toggle.onclick=()=>{if(!dialog.open)dialog.showModal();};","new":"toggle.onclick=event=>{event.preventDefault();event.stopPropagation();if(dialog.open){dialog.close();return;}dialog.showModal();if(!window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches)dialog.animate([{transform:'translateY(24px)',opacity:0},{transform:'translateY(0)',opacity:1}],{duration:180,easing:'ease-out'});};"}]}
